# The whole directory is runtime state: schema is applied on boot and the
# database is created from .env, so nothing here belongs in version control.
# Ignored wholesale because enumerating extensions keeps missing the backup
# files the migrator leaves behind, and those contain seeded customers and
# password hashes.
server/data/

# user uploads
server/uploads/avatars/*
!server/uploads/avatars/.gitkeep

